    "description": {
      "type": "/type/text",
      "value": "A string theorist and a citizen scientist instruct lay readers on elementary principles of physics and associated math that amateur enthusiasts should know in order to study more advanced topics, in a reference that covers such topics as classical mechanics, electromagnetic fields and chaos theory.\n\n\"A first course in physics and associated math for the ardent amateur ... beginning with classical mechanics\"--Dust jacket flap."
